# .cursorrules - Master AI Instructions for SIH 2026 Team

# --- PROJECT PATHS & CONTRACTS ---
# API Contract: docs/api-contract.md
# Database Schema: docs/schema.sql
# Seed Data: docs/data/
# Frontend Directory: /frontend
# Backend Directory: /backend

# --- GENERAL CONVENTIONS ---
# 1. API Route Prefix: /api/v1 (e.g., /api/v1/schemes/recommend)
# 2. JSON/Java DTO Fields: camelCase (e.g., annualIncome, projectCost)
# 3. PostgreSQL Columns: snake_case (e.g., annual_income, project_cost)
# 4. Local Execution Ports:
#    - Spring Boot Backend: http://localhost:8080
#    - React Vite Frontend: http://localhost:5173

# --- BACKEND RULES (Java Spring Boot) ---
# - Location: /backend
# - Java 17+, Maven, Spring Boot 3.x
# - Use Lombok (@Data, @Builder, @NoArgsConstructor, @AllArgsConstructor)
# - Enforce Global CORS for http://localhost:5173
# - Refer strictly to docs/api-contract.md for DTO fields and REST endpoint definitions
# - SQL Scripts & PostGIS spatial queries go in docs/schema.sql

# --- FRONTEND RULES (React + Vite) ---
# - Location: /frontend
# - Styling: Tailwind CSS
# - Icons: Lucide React (lucide-react)
# - Maps: Leaflet / React-Leaflet
# - API Integration: Axios client configured via import.meta.env.VITE_API_BASE_URL
# - Map component state and payload structures directly to docs/api-contract.md